type: "dataset"
title: "AI Foundations: Source Trace Irreversibility"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-06"

authors:
  - family-names: "Solen"
    given-names: "Alyssa"

abstract: "A compact formal model of source, trajectory, reverse source-tracing, irreversibility, and later reconstruction. The model distinguishes recovery of source structure from reoccupation of an original historical coordinate and shows why a later reconstructed state begins a new provenance line rather than replacing the trajectory that made reconstruction possible."

